  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt syftar till att skapa p&#xe5;litlig och god                  vattenf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning till befolkningen i Kutaisi kommun. Detta g&#xf6;rs      genom en rehabilitering av infrastrukturen, som finansieras av        investeringsl&#xe5;n fr&#xe5;n EBRD och kompletterande bidrag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kutaisi Water Supply Project have the objective of restoring a    reliable, good quality water supply to the population of the          municipality. This will be done through a rehabilitation of water     infrastructure, financed by investment loans from EBRD and            complemented by grant co-financing.</narrative>
  </description>
